_is_one_attempt_and_preserves_destination\r\nFAILED tests/test_h04_pack_index_repair_spec.py::PackIndexRepairSpecTests::test_cl003_help_and_cli_error_are_operator_facing\r\n2 failed, 4 passed in 0.79s\r\n   Building pyocd-debug-mcp @ file:///C:/Users/Jason/Documents/Jason/FirmCLI_Tester/Firmware-Test-Manual/MCP-Trial-3/BYO-Firmware-MCP\n      Built pyocd-debug-mcp @ file:///C:/Users/Jason/Documents/Jason/FirmCLI_Tester/Firmware-Test-Manual/MCP-Trial-3/BYO-Firmware-MCP\nInstalled 64 packages in 11.17s\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
