ce.\n+test_reset_connect_ignores_ambient_uid_and_target_but_normal_resolution_keeps_compatibility (tests.test_regression_change_loop.ResetConnectRoutingRegressionTests.test_reset_connect_ignores_ambient_uid_and_target_but_normal_resolution_keeps_compatibility) ... ok\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/regression_test_output.log:12: trailing whitespace.\n+\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/regression_test_output.log:13: trailing whitespace.\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/regression_test_output.log:14: trailing whitespace.\n+Ran 11 tests in 0.098s\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/regression_test_output.log:15: trailing whitespace.\n+\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/regression_test_output.log:16: trailing whitespace.\n+OK\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/spec_test_output.log:1: trailing whitespace.\n+............\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/spec_test_output.log:2: trailing whitespace.\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/spec_test_output.log:3: trailing whitespace.\n+Ran 12 tests in 1.294s\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/spec_test_output.log:4: trailing whitespace.\n+\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/spec_test_output.log:5: trailing whitespace.\n+OK\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/test_report.md:9: trailing whitespace.\n+............\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/test_report.md:10: trailing whitespace.\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/test_report.md:11: trailing whitespace.\n+Ran 12 tests in 1.294s\r\n.change-loop/archive/setup-relocking-20260723/state/test_report.md: