space.\n+                FieldType.BOOLEAN,\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:216: trailing whitespace.\n+                \"True only when this firmware workflow uses UART.\",\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:217: trailing whitespace.\n+            ),\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:218: trailing whitespace.\n+            _field(\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:219: trailing whitespace.\n+                \"serial_baudrate\",\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:220: trailing whitespace.\n+                FieldType.INTEGER,\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:221: trailing whitespace.\n+                \"Positive UART baud rate when requires_uart is true; otherwise NULL.\",\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrails/plan_defs.py:222: trailing whitespace.\n+                nullable=True,\r\nsrc/pyocd_debug_mcp/guardrail","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
